Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:26.92,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:26.92,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}兹维列夫 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}3-6 6-3 6-3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 诺里 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Sasha, the good news
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,萨沙 好消息是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:05.26,EN,,0,0,0,,is you've hit breakfast TV audience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,你这场打进了欧洲的早餐档
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:07.92,EN,,0,0,0,,in Europe, so well done for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:10.36,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you improve in your game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚这场球打下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:13.18,EN,,0,0,0,,as the match went along tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,状态是怎么一点点找回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:15.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it was actually, which is funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:15.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,说来有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I was practicing quite well here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:16.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在这儿的训练一直不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,which is very different to Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,和在加拿大完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I was practicing terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在加拿大我训练得一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:20.46,EN,,0,0,0,,I was playing terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛也打得一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,everything was terrible in Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那儿什么都是一塌糊涂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,So I knew that I had to get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我知道我得先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:28.44,EN,,0,0,0,,into a match with him, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:28.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟他把这场球打起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:29.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been playing well this season,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个赛季我状态一直不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,but my confidence was not there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,可信心没了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:33.42,EN,,0,0,0,,because I lost first round of Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为加拿大首轮就输了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.98,EN,,0,0,0,,It was about finding your rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,关键是在比赛里找回节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:35.74,EN,,0,0,0,,on the match court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,在真正的赛场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and I did that, and the first set wasn't great,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我做到了 第一盘打得不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but then afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但从那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:41.68,EN,,0,0,0,,second and third sets were really high level,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘和第三盘水平很高
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一点我挺满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:43.98,EN,,0,0,0,,You had a lot of break points
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:43.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,你拿到过不少破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.70,EN,,0,0,0,,that didn't go your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.98,0:00:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,没能转化
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:46.98,EN,,0,0,0,,You managed yourself well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你自己稳住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:48.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and you had to match Cam's intensity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且要顶住诺里那股强度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:51.08,EN,,0,0,0,,you always do, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,对他你每次都得这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:52.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, look, the break points
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 你看 那些破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,that you have, it's really difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,在他手上真的很难接
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to return on the outside against him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是外角这一边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:59.20,EN,,0,0,0,,because he has an incredible serve out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,他外角发球太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:00.70,EN,,0,0,0,,wide, and he has a very good serve T,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且他打 T 点也很准
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:03.90,EN,,0,0,0,,so it's definitely much more difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以在左区拿分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:05.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to win points on that side of the court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,明显比在右区难得多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.02,EN,,0,0,0,,than on the deuce side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,难上不少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:09.86,EN,,0,0,0,,But I still, I feel like I didn't play
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:09.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,但在我看来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:11.62,EN,,0,0,0,,the break points badly, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:11.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,那些破发点我没打坏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:12.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I didn't lose them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是我自己丢掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:14.84,EN,,0,0,0,,He was playing really well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是他打得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:17.56,EN,,0,0,0,,it was a lot of the time, serve plus one,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多时候是发球接一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:19.26,EN,,0,0,0,,he was being aggressive in the rallies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.56,0:01:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,回合里他也很主动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.46,EN,,0,0,0,,and I knew that I'm going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我知道机会还会有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:22.50,EN,,0,0,0,,to get more chances, and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,后面还会来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:24.08,EN,,0,0,0,,once I did, I used him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,机会一来 我抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:25.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Super job, mate, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:26.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:26.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
